<title>HONG KONG: Citibank sets call warrants on red-chip basket.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call warrants on red-chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A., Hong Kong Branch, said on Friday it has issued 300 million American-style call warrants on a basket of red chips.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd				  0.075 shrs</p>
<p> Guangdong Investment Ltd			 0.1   shrs</p>
<p> Ng Fung Hong Ltd				   0.15  shrs</p>
<p> Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd			  0.125 shrs</p>
<p> China Resources Beijing Land Ltd	     0.175 shrs</p>
<p> China Aerospace International Holdings Ltd 0.2   shrs</p>
<p> China Everbright IHD Holdings Ltd	    0.05  shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$6.8479	  PREMIUM	 15.95 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1975	  GEARING	 3.85X</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$7.6088	  MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> MATURITY	    27.JAN.98	  LISTING DATE  05.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
